# Ad-hoc scripts / one-off logs at repo root. Anchored with a leading slash:
# unanchored, `_*.js` also matched server/routes/_shared.js, which every route
# module requires — it silently stayed out of git and the committed tree could
# not boot.
/_*.js
/_*.log
